    color:'#60a040',
    desc:'Best growth. Rain waters crops at dawn — saves your can. Hunger drains slower.',
    changeMsg:'🌧️ Spring rain. Your crops will drink for free at dawn. Hunger eases. Best planting window of the year.' },
